<title>BELGIUM: Belgian New Year girl gets Xmas brother.</title>
<headline>Belgian New Year girl gets Xmas brother.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Shauna Vandamme, born on January 1, 1996, got a little brother, Jordy, on Christmas of the same year.</p>
<p>Father Gerdy Vandamme of Izegem, western Belgium, told Reuters that the family's oldest child -- five-year old Angelo -- was born just one day short of Easter in 1991.</p>
<p>&quot;It is easy to remember their birthdays,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
